# DIAGNOSTICS

Given fewer than two arguments it prints its usage and exits `usage`; it exits `start` when proc refuses the start command (a word it doesn't know, or the kernel can't make rings), `stop`, `mkdir` or `copy` when that step fails.

# BUGS

A recording is held in memory on the node, each CPU's ring and then the whole file: its pages times 5 KiB per CPU, twice.
The rings keep the first records and drop the rest once full: a long or busy recording needs more pages, which `vx trace profile` says when it is short.
